==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*metnǫti ||to throw}}. {{surf|ru|мета́ть|-ну́ть}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|метну́ть}}
* {{rhymes|ru|utʲ|s=2}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|метну́ть|pf|impf=мета́ть}}

# to [[throw]], to [[cast]], to [[fling]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''метну́ть''' [[диск]]|to throw the discus}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''метну́ть''' [[копьё]]|to throw the javelin}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''метну́ть''' [[жре́бий]]|cast lots}}

====Usage notes====
A rare and awkward past passive participle {{m|ru|мётнутый}} is occasionally found.

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|3b|метну́ть|ppp=-}}

====Derived terms====
* ''See {{m|ru|мета́ть}} for derived verbs.''

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|мета́тель}}, {{l|ru|мета́тельный}}
